0}^{n-1}[ln⁡(e+\\frac{4ie}{n})\\cdot \\frac{4e}{n}]"] [17592186393256 :answer/value "{lim}_{n\\to \\infty }{\\sum }_{i=0}^{n-1}[ln⁡(e+\\frac{ie}{n})\\cdot \\frac{e}{n}]"]]}]